WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.139
Welcome to Module 2 of Global Secure
Access as the Identity-Aware Network:

2
00:00:05.139 --> 00:00:07.475
the client and Microsoft traffic.

3
00:00:07.475 --> 00:00:10.860
Everything after this module
depends on two things:

4
00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:15.819
a client on every managed Windows
device, and the Microsoft traffic profile

5
00:00:15.819 --> 00:00:20.463
carrying that device's Microsoft three
sixty-five and Entra I D traffic.

6
00:00:20.463 --> 00:00:26.324
This module covers Steps 3 and 4 of the
Global Secure Access implementation guide.

7
00:00:26.324 --> 00:00:30.620
It takes about forty-five minutes,
plus a lab in your own test tenant.
